{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「統整了大家的情報後，媽媽喵所在的地點……」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": "sn1624", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這附近嗎……相當高的地方呢。」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": "sn1625", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "結姬女子學園的西北邊是一片寬闊的丘陵地帶。", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "附近人煙稀少，是沒有進行過土地開發的地區。", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要側耳傾聽，就能聽到蟲鳴鳥叫。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感覺自己也成為大自然的一部份。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "對動物們來說，是無法取代的珍貴棲息地。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「距離學校有點距離呢……」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "ar4477", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "從崖坡上可以一覽整個舊市街。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也看得見遠處的結女校舍。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，大家的情報是正確的嗎？」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「當然了！因為安潔在學校的後園發現媽媽喵之後，就一直跟著牠！」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "ag3461", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我跟櫻乃是迷路到這裡來，偶然看見的。」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "ar4478", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一如計畫。」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "sk1340", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那個時候，結果還是我去接她們回來了……", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也在家附近看到牠往這個方向逃走了，所以可能性很高。」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": "sn1626", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「結論就是這樣，該怎麼做呢？」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "mu2166", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家的視線都集中到美羽學姊身上。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然後，學姊點點頭正要開口的時候。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "母ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕……」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "？？？", "alt_speaker_idx": 305, "voice": "mp0000", "char_id": "母ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「！？」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "mu2167", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不可能聽錯的那個特殊叫聲。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「剛、剛才那個……」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "ar4479", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「噓！安靜一點。」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": "sn1627", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "sk1341", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們屏氣凝神。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然後，在森林的深處看見一個小小的身影。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "母ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "熊喵媽媽", "alt_speaker_idx": 291, "voice": "mp0001", "char_id": "母ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "子ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕嚕！」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "小熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": "kp0000", "char_id": "子ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……出現了。」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "ar4480", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不會錯的，是媽媽喵。」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": "sn1628", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也有小隻的。」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "sk1342", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "親子的花紋不一樣呢。", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好可愛喔……讓安潔好想帶回家裡去～」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "ag3462", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學姊。」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯，我覺得不會錯了。」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "mu2168", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「幾年前跟小紗凪看見的，小熊喵的媽媽……」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "mu2169", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這下就確定了。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "熊喵的母親還活著，而且生活在這片森林裡。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以這裡……就是熊喵該回去的地方。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「總之，先走遠一點別嚇到牠們吧。」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說的也是，這裡不是人類可以踐踏的地方。」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": "sn1629", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼時候要把熊喵帶來？」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "ar4481", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔覺得越快越好。」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "ag3463", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「社長，請做決定。」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "sk1343", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "mu2170", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽學姊再次點點頭看著我們。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明天，就把小熊喵帶來這裡。」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "mu2171", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等小熊喵回到媽媽的身邊後……大家就把這個地方忘記。」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "mu2172", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「請絕對不要再來到這裡。」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "mu2173", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說的也是，畢竟希望這裡是能讓動物們安心生活的場所……」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "ar4482", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "sk1344", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要跟熊喵小姐分開，安潔好寂寞……」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "ag3464", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": "sn1630", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，熊喵需要一個能回去的地方。」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": "sn1631", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「牠不能一直跟總有一天會畢業離開的我們在一起。」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": "sn1632", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說的也是……」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "ar4483", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔不能這麼消沉呢！因為熊喵小姐能跟媽媽喵重逢了！」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "ag3465", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "mu2174", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……美羽學姊。」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": "sn1633", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、嗯。怎麼了，小紗凪？」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "mu2175", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": "sn1634", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，什麼都沒有。」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": "sn1635", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "mu2176", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼了，紗凪？」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": "sn1636", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在探路的回程中，紗凪一個人漸漸落後。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「走累了嗎？」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我的職責就到這裡了。」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": "sn1637", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你懂的吧？美羽學姊對熊喵……」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": "sn1638", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "說到一半，紗凪咬住下唇。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她這段時間以來總是很積極尋找熊喵的母親。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我後來也注意到了那並不是她的本意。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「接下來就交給你了。」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": "sn1639", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道。」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然美羽學姊沒有說出口，但她內心一定是不想跟熊喵分開的。", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "為了讓她不用去找熊喵的母親，紗凪才會這麼努力。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉……要領導其他人好累喔。我還是一個人行動比較輕鬆。」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": "sn1640", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉，讓紗凪妳辛苦了。」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": "sn1641", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這些溫柔的話搞錯對象了，笨蛋。」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": "sn1642", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "紗凪拍拍我的背，然後繼續向前走。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她遞來的接力棒，我必續確實傳遞下去才行。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
